* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ttf binary
*.ico binary
# Aurora patches are applied byte for byte and their SHA-1 decides whether the Aurora checkout is reset and patched
# again (CMakeLists.txt): never convert their line endings (0004 holds CRLF lines; a normalised copy in a worktree
# gave another hash, and two source trees sharing one Aurora folder then reset it under each other, 2026-11-10).
third_party/patches/aurora/*.patch -text
